{"sourceUrl":"https://ee.jlu.edu.cn/info/1038/9157.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:05.703246+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ee.jlu.edu.cn/info/1038/9157.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、报考条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（一）硕士生</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，具有正确的政治方向，热爱祖国，愿意为社会主义现代化建设服务，遵纪守法，品行端正。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.具有所在学校推免生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较好的专业素养，有较强的创新意识和创新能力，有较高的培养潜质。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.身体和心理状况符合国家和招生单位规定的体检要求。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（二）直博生</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，具有正确的政治方向，热爱祖国，愿意为社会主义现代化建设服务，遵纪守法，品行端正。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.具有所在学校推免生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.学习成绩优秀，对学术研究有浓厚兴趣，有较好的专业素养，有较强的创新意识和创新能力，有较高的培养潜质。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.身体和心理健康状况符合国家和招生单位规定。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.有至少两名所报考学科专业领域内的教授(或相当专业技术职称的专家)的书面推荐意见。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、招生计划</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>我院</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年推免生招生计划详见</span></span><span><span>吉林大学招生网（网址：</span></span><a href=\"https://zsb.jlu.edu.cn/info/3173.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://zsb.jlu.edu.cn/info/3173.html</span></span></span></a><span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（一）硕士生</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>招收硕士</span></span><span><span>生专业目录内各专业的招生计划仅供考生参考，在录取阶段，我院将根据学科发展需要、生源质量等情况对各专业的推免生招生计划做适当增减。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（二）直博生</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>招收直博生是指选拔具有推免生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生直接取得博士生入学资格的招生方式。直博生基础学制</span><span>5年。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、复试方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学院</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年推免生复试工作统一采用现场</span></span><span><span>面试</span></span><span><span>方式。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试地点：吉林省长春市前进大街</span><span>2699号吉林大学中心校区唐敖庆楼D区</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>校外考生进校：微信搜索公众号</span><span>“961946 JLU”，提请做好入学访客登记即可。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>预报名及资格审查</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（一）线上预报名</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>报名网址：</span><span>https://yzb.jlu.edu.cn/</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>点击推免生预报名</span><span>2026）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>截止时间：</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span><span>16</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>周二）</span><span>12:00</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（二）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>线上预审查</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>预审核网址：</span></span><a href=\"https://jluese.wjx.cn/vm/OduigPJ.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://jluese.wjx.cn/vm/OduigPJ.aspx</span></span></span></a> </p>\n<p><span><span>截止时间：</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span><span>18</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>周四）</span><span>24:00</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>请预推免考生提交预审核材料，提交材料视为确认参加复试，</span></span><span><span>预审核合格名单将公布在学院主页网站上，</span><span>QQ群内及时通知考生。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>特别说明：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>仅招收第一志愿的学生报名，逾期不予补报。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span><span>参加我院</span><span>“2025年校园学术开放日”</span></span><span><span>并在活动中学术能力考核合格的同学，考核成绩可以作为推免阶段的重要参考依据，如果确认报考我院，一定要参加线上预报名和预审核，可不参加复试。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.预选合格的直博生不需要参加线上预报名。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（三）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>现场资格</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>审查</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>    <span>时间：</span><span>2025年9月22日</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>周一）下午</span><span>13:00-16:00</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>地点：吉林大学中心校区唐敖庆楼</span><span>D区324</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>资格审查不合格或材料造假者，将取消复试和录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（四）资格审查相关</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>材料</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>《吉林大学</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生申请表》</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>原件</span><span>+电子版）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>加盖所在学校教务部门公章的本科期间成绩单</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>原件</span><span>+电子版）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.在校期间发表的论文、获得专利的证书、研究成果证明、获奖证书、外语水平考试证书等材料</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>电子版）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>长期有效第二代居民身份证（原件查验）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.学生证或一卡通</span></span><span><span>（原件查验）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>申请直博生须提交两名所报考学科专业领域内的教授</span><span>(或相当专业技术职称的专家)的书面推荐意见</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>原件）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>考生联络</span></span><span><span>QQ</span></span><span><span>群号：</span><span>720338916，（验证信息：姓名-所在学校）方便及时沟通和获取后续信息。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、复试安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>时间：</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span><span>23</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>周二）全天</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>地点：吉林大学中心校区唐敖庆楼</span><span>D区3楼</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>分组：具体分组安排另行通知</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>见</span><span>QQ群</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试</span></span><span><span>考核（</span><span>100分）：现场面试，主要考查</span></span><span><span>外语听说能力、</span></span><span><span>专业素质和能力</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>综合素质和能力，主要内容包括：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>专业素质和能力包括</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>大学阶段学习情况及成绩</span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>全面考核推免生对本学科</span><span>(类别)、专业(领域)理论知识和应用技能掌握程度，利用所学理论发现、分析和解决问题的能力，对本学科(类别)发展动态的了解以及在本专业(领域)发展的能力</span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>创新精神和创新能力。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>综合素质和能力包括</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>思想政治素质和品德考核，内容应包含推免生的政治态度、思想表现、道德品质、遵纪守法、诚实守信等方面</span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>本学科</span><span>(类别)、专业(领域)以外的学习、科研、社会实践(学生工作、社团活动、志愿者服务等)或实际工作表现等方面的情况</span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>事业心、责任感、纪律性</span><span>(遵纪守法)、协作性</span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>人文素养</span><span>;心理健康情况。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试</span></span><span><span>成绩</span></span><span><span>将公布在学院主页网站上，</span><span>QQ群内及时通知考生。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>六</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、复试成绩及录取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.复试成绩满分100分，60分以上（含60分）为合格。复试不合格者不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.思想政治素质和道德品质考核不合格者不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.拟录取推免生严格按照复试成绩由高到低择优录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>.我院“2025年校园学术开放日”并在活动中学术能力考核合格的同学，具备推荐免试硕士研究生资格者，且服从专业调剂，在符合我校接收推荐免试硕士研究生相关要求和学院相关政策基础上，完成线上预报名和预审核合格，</span></span><span><span>考核成绩可以</span></span><span><span>作</span></span><span><span>为推免阶段的</span></span><span><span>复试成绩，可不参加复试。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.录取工作在“全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（</span></span><span><span>网址：</span></span><a href=\"https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/</span></span></span></a><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>简称</span><span>“推免系统”）上进行。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6.学院拟录取的推免生</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>包括硕士生、直博生）需提前进校</span></span><span><span>“推免系统”的注册工作</span></span><span><span>和网上填报志愿</span></span><span><span>，并在</span></span><span><span>学院规定时间内</span></span><span><span>通过</span><span>“推免系统”完成网上“同意复试”和“同意待录取”</span></span><span><span>两步</span></span><span><span>确认。逾期不接受者，取消拟录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>七</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、信息公开</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学院网站公示各专业拟录取推免生名单，公示期为</span><span>3天。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>咨询电话：</span><span>0431-85168416</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>举报电话：</span><span>0431-85168414</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>吉林大学电子科学与工程学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"346278b760827f06295483870a14e99d46c1ba4e746cc65f2a5122900b93ee77","textLength":2277,"sourceSha256":"bed6e62d5e8f3089bb4f4b529d8f16045c31df2dc8288978447004d64686d840","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"吉林大学2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生直接攻读博士研究生专家推荐书.docx","url":"https://ee.jlu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1402736124&wbfileid=16645314"},{"name":"吉林大学2026年接收推荐免试研究生申请表.docx","url":"https://ee.jlu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1402736124&wbfileid=16645313"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-0ee454e6da72a4d5d148","title":"2025年吉林大学电子科学与工程学院2026年接收推荐免试攻读研究生复试录取工作办法","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:05.703246+00:00"}
